{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "Start",
      "text": "Wind scrapes dust across Frontier Outpost Seven as the barrier lowers halfway.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GateChallenge",
      "text": "State your business before the sun touches the ridge.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "NegotiationHub",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ScoutRead",
      "text": "Two sentries favor their left knees, and the signal horn hangs unwatched beside the gate crank.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ScoutChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "FatigueArgument",
      "text": "You noticed that quickly. Speak, then.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "VulnerabilityHint",
      "text": "Careful. Spotting weaknesses can sound like planning an attack.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "SuspicionChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "AdviceAccepted",
      "text": "Useful eyes deserve a fair hearing.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CaravanPitch",
      "text": "Sick miners, you say? Then prove they are real and not smugglers in blankets.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CaravanChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "PapersShown",
      "text": "The manifests match last week's convoy numbers.",
      "speaker": "Clerk Iven",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MercyAppeal",
      "text": "If your story is true, delay costs lives.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MissingSeal",
      "text": "Broken seals invite inspections. Give me one reason not to hold every wagon.",
      "speaker": "Clerk Iven",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MissingSealChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "InspectionDelay",
      "text": "The delay will cost the miners a night without medicine.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DelayChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BribeAttempt",
      "text": "Wrong gate for that mistake.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "GuildThreat",
      "text": "I answer to the frontier office, not guild gossip.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PassageTerms",
      "text": "One escort rider, no covered crates, and you leave before dusk.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PassageChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "FeeWaiver",
      "text": "Waive the fee and the stores come out of my ledgers. Convince me.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "FeeWaiverChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "TreatyWin",
      "text": "Hm. Clause nine does cover medical relief.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "SaltBargain",
      "text": "Salt spends faster than coin out here. Done.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DelayedPassage",
      "text": "The wagons roll through long after sunset, and several crates of herbs are ruined by frost.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BitterPassage",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractPitch",
      "text": "Supplies buy goodwill. Guarantees buy gates.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "LedgerReview",
      "text": "These numbers could keep us warm for a month.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CharterClaim",
      "text": "Bold citation. If it holds, the outpost owes you a hearing.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "CharterProof",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ThinClaim",
      "text": "Then do not waste my patrol's time.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractBribe",
      "text": "Second bribe today. You're either careless or desperate.",
      "speaker": "Commander Vela",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractTerms",
      "text": "Deliver lamp oil, grain, and spare bowstrings within six days, and I'll sign.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractDecision",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "ExtendedDeadline",
      "text": "Seven days. Miss it, and the bond is forfeit.",
      "speaker": "Quartermaster Suri",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AidGranted",
      "text": "The barrier lifts, the caravan rattles through, and the outpost lanterns stay green behind you.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "ContractSealed",
      "text": "Ink dries on the supply bond, and the sentries mark your name as trusted.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "QuietRetreat",
      "text": "You withdraw before the talks sour, leaving only bootprints in the dust.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "Detained",
      "text": "Iron cuffs close around your wrists while the horn echoes across the wall.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlarmRaised",
      "text": "The unattended horn screams once, and crossbows appear along the rampart.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "Start",
      "to": "GateChallenge",
      "text": ""
    },
