      "text": "1. Request emergency passage for a medical caravan."
    },
    {
      "from": "NegotiationHub",
      "to": "ContractPitch",
      "text": "2. Offer a salvage-and-supply contract."
    },
    {
      "from": "NegotiationHub",
      "to": "ScoutRead",
      "text": "3. [Observe] Study the sentries before speaking."
    },
    {
      "from": "NegotiationHub",
      "to": "QuietRetreat",
      "text": "4. Withdraw before the talks sour."
    },
    {
      "from": "ScoutRead",
      "to": "ScoutChoice",
      "text": ""
