    {
      "from": "ScoutChoice",
      "to": "FatigueArgument",
      "text": "1. Mention the exhausted sentries to argue for urgency."
    },
    {
      "from": "ScoutChoice",
      "to": "VulnerabilityHint",
      "text": "2. Note the exposed horn and imply the outpost is vulnerable."
    },
    {
      "from": "ScoutChoice",
      "to": "NegotiationHub",
      "text": "3. Return to the main negotiation."
    },
    {
      "from": "FatigueArgument",
