      "to": "AdviceAccepted",
      "text": "1. Clarify that you are offering free advice."
    },
    {
      "from": "SuspicionChoice",
      "to": "AlarmRaised",
      "text": "2. Double down and threaten to spread the rumor."
    },
    {
      "from": "SuspicionChoice",
      "to": "NegotiationHub",
      "text": "3. Return to the main negotiation."
    },
    {
      "from": "AdviceAccepted",
      "to": "NegotiationHub",
